Z||000029||FieroGTGirl||05-06-2000||11:15 PM||||Yes, I am married.  He is actually the one to get me soo much into Fieros.  I didn't really notice one until I got to drive one!  We had a 91 Geo Metro(yes it was a 3 cyl lawnmower engine) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  The Geo was going bad (valves burnt twice) and we saw a 86 Silver SE for sale.  We went to dealer and made a straight across exchange.  That is when I found out about Fieros.  Then about 3 years ago we got an opportunity to trade our 86 SE(automatic~~~I hate automatics)  for the black GT (4 speed~~ohhh so fun!) we have now.  Now I want to get mods for the engine, brakes, and suspension, and a DIFFERENT color of paint.  Black is NOT a good color in the northwest region....Tooo hard to keep looking good...<P>||||reg||1
