Z||000044||Robert||05-07-2000||04:56 PM||||Welcome FieroGTGirl & Sillhouette.<BR>In an effort to show the feminine side of “Thunder” I took a shot of him at my local tennis courts the other day.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87fieroflower.JPG"> <P>  As you can see, I’m partial to yellow, but am always willing to welcome any Fiero owners, no matter what their color.   Thunder was painted at the Fiero Shop by George and Crew not long ago (about 150 washes), man that yellow really shows the dirt.  We’ll be at the regionals in San Diego this coming July, maybe you can make it down there.  My wife isn’t going to be able to make the trip, so there will be extra space in my hotel room if you need some place to stay.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  You don’t need to worry about my intentions; I have promised my wife I’ll be good.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Hope to hear from you soon.  <P>Robert<P>(Don’t tell my wife I wrote this….. OK?)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <P>||||reg||10
